  <div class="section-head subhead"><div><p class="eyebrow">Arithmetic reconciliation</p><h2>Check the totals against the individual assets.</h2></div><p>Compare the figures below with the published register. A matching result confirms that the disclosed inputs reconcile with the portfolio totals.</p></div>
